<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission shall have all such powers as may be necessary for or in connection with, or reasonably incidental to, the performance of its functions under the laws specified in the First Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
