<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_III__cl_20> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_III> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_III__cl_20> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "20" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
