<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Directors shall be subject to the direction and control of the Chief Executive Officer and they may perform all the duties of the Chief Executive Officer under this Act and the laws specified in the First Schedule as may be specified by the Chief Executive Officer."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
