<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, from time to time, give to the Commission directions of a general character consistent with the provisions of this Act relating to the Commission's functions, and the Commission shall give effect to such directions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_14> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
