<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of the Commission or any committee who has or acquires a direct or indirect interest by himself, a member of his family or his associate in relation to any matter under discussion by the Commission or committee shall disclose to the Commission or committee, as the case may be, the fact of his interest and its nature."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_2__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
