<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "shall be disregarded for the purpose of constituting a quorum of the meeting of the Commission or committee, as the case may be; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
