<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_IV__cl_21__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Until such time as the terms and conditions of service of its employees are drawn up by the Commission, the scheme and terms and conditions of service of employees of the Government shall continue to apply to every person employed by the Commission under subsection (1)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
