<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission may, from time to time, appoint and employ on such terms and conditions as the Commission may think fit such other employees as may be necessary for the proper administration of this Act and the laws specified in the First Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
