<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission may appoint and employ consultants and agents to transact any business or to do any act required to be transacted or done in the execution of its functions or for the better carrying into effect the purposes of this Act. Regulations with respect to employment"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
