<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Companies Commission of Malaysia Act 2001."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
