<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette, and the Minister may appoint different dates for different provisions of this Act. Interpretation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
