<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI> <https://schema.org/text> "GENERAL Institution of prosecution"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
