<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36> <https://schema.org/text> "No prosecution for any offence under this Act and the laws specified in the First Schedule shall be instituted except by or with the consent in writing of the Public Prosecutor. Proceedings conducted by officers of Commission"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
