<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Except as provided in this Act or for the purpose of any civil or criminal proceedings under any written law, no member, officer, employee or agent of the Commission, whether during his tenure of office or during his employment or after that, and no other person who has by any means access to any information or document relating to the affairs of the Commission shall give or otherwise disclose such information or document to any person."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
