<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and on conviction shall be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both. Power of Minister to amend the First and Second Schedules"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
