<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI__cl_39> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, amend the First and Second Schedules. Regulations"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
