<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, on the recommendation of the Commission, make such regulations as may be expedient or necessary for carrying out the purposes of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
