<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Before the beginning of each financial year, an estimate of the expenditure for the following financial year in such form and containing such particulars as the Minister may direct shall be submitted by the Commission to the Minister for his approval, and the Minister shall, before the beginning of that following financial year, notify the Commission of the amount authorized for expenditure generally or of the amounts authorized for each description of expenditure."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
