<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission may, at any time, submit to the Minister a supplementary estimate for any one financial year and the Minister may allow the whole or any part of the additional expenditure included in it. Conservation of Fund"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
