<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission may, from time to time, with the prior approval of the Minister and the Minister of Finance, borrow, at such rate of interest and for such period and upon such terms as to the time and method of repayment and otherwise as the Minister and the Minister of Finance may approve, any sums required by the Commission for meeting any of its obligations or performing any of its functions under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_V__cl_33> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
