<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@/~part_V__cl_33__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission may, from time to time, with the approval of the Minister, borrow money by the issue of bonds, debentures, debenture stocks or such other securities upon such terms as it deems expedient for meeting any of its obligations or performing any of its functions under this Act. Investment"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/19/eng@> .
